@startuml
title Browser
header draft
footer end
caption a request
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "User" as U
rectangle "Cache" as C
WB has Idle, Processing, Waiting
U is Ready
C is Empty
@0
WB is Idle
U is Clicking
C is Miss
@100
WB is Processing
U -> WB : URL
@200
WB is Waiting
C is Hit
WB@100 <-> @200 : {100 ms}
highlight 0 to 200 #Gold : request
note top of U : clicks
@enduml
